  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi namutu wami wadiŋi ŋiya dameji, nimesu ami adiŋi kaselokikamadilu kulonda nidilaŋa nimwaana niwufuku antu amwana kawakwetu wamumbanda anajahuwu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi nadiŋi nankunka mwisaŋa yashikenaŋawu akwakwenda, kulonda nishiyi akwetu, nifumi kudi wena! Muloŋa wejima wawu hiyayivumbi hohu, hichipompelu chawakwakukwatila akwawu si makasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Evulaŋa madimi awu neyi mata awu anyikunji kulonda kutwamba, ela dehi akwaŋovu mwituŋa, ilaŋa hiŋovu yakwila yakashinshuku. Muloŋa elaŋa afuma kukutama iku aya kukutama kukwawu, nikuŋiluka hiyaŋilukaku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wenu babelenu akwenu mwatuŋa nawu, bayi mukuhwelela mana kwenu niwumuku; muloŋa ana kwenu ejima akasweja kudya yuma yawakwawu, niakwenu ejima mwatuŋa nawu akakimbukaŋa kwanambonji hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akela iwu nakudimba mukwawu atuŋayi nindi, iwu nakudimba mukwawu atuŋayi nindi, hiyakahosha mwalalaku; madimi awu anayileji dehi kuhosha yakutwamba; adikabakeshaŋa nakwila yakuluwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiwashakama washakama hakachi kakudimbana; kukudimbana kwawu kwokwananlekeluwu kuŋiluka. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, nukuyisuŋununa niyeseki; ochu nadi kwila mwacheŋi mudihi nansaŋu yamwana kawakwetu wamumbanda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idimi dawu hinsewu yafwana; dahoshaŋa yakudimbana; iwu nakanwa kindi wahoshaŋa jakumwena namukwawu atuŋayi nindi, ilaŋa mumuchima windi mudi kumweba hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nileki kuyi-hempula nayumiyi, tahindi? Nileki kuditenda namuza wudi chochichuku, tahindi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukukwata kudila nakutumpa nansaŋu jamapidi, nukutumbula mukeŋa nansaŋu jamadiilu awayimuna mwisaŋa, muloŋa anasukumi dehi bwi-i, chakwila nimuntu wakutwesha kuhitamu nehi; antu nawa hiyakutwesha kutiya izu dawayimunaku; niatujila ahaluzwizu, nianyama anatemuki, anayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusalema nukumubalumuna kwanyilumba nyilumba, mwikali muwushakaminu wawanyumbu; nyikala yamuYuda nukuyibalumuna kwikala yihembi yakadi akushakamamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwamaana hinyi kulonda ashinshiki chumichi? Kanwa kaYehova kanahoshi nanyi, kulonda achishimuni? Ituŋa dinanoŋelidi? Dinasukuminidi neyi isaŋa, mwaka mubuli wakuhitamu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Ochu chanalekuwu nshimbi jami jinashili kumesu awu, nichanabuli kwovwahilawu izu dami, hela kwendamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anendi mwaya kuchinchika kwanyichima yawu awenawu, nimwaya aBayali ayilejeluwu ankakulula jawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dichi Yehova wamazaza, Nzambi yaIsarela, nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, chalala antu awa nakayidiisha mutondu walula, nakayinwisha meji awulembi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayimwaŋila mwahita nyuza yabulili kwilukawu wenahela ankakulula jawu. Nakayilondesha mpoku yakabali nichinakayinoŋesha to-o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nahoshi nindi, Toŋojokenu chachiwahi, mutambiki ambanda akweti mudimu wakudila, kulonda akenzi, mutambiki ambanda akweti maana, kulonda akenzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanyakali, akatu kwatili mudimu wakutumpa, kulonda mumesu etu mupolomoki madilu, munlabu jetu namutupuki chimeji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa muZiyona munatiyakani izu dakutumpa, nawu, Ochanatupupuwu! Tunabayi dehi kwetu chakubadika, muloŋa tunafumi dehi mwituŋa, muloŋa anasandi dehi nimataletu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, tiyenu izu daYehova enu ambanda, matu enu atambuli izu dakukanwa kindi, muleji anyanenu awambanda muwutumpilu, wejima wenu muleji akwenu tuŋa nawu mukeŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa kufwa kwakandama dehi, kuneŋili dehi janina jetu, kuneŋili dehi mumataletu amaneni amawahi, kulonda lishuhu anyanetu adi hanzi, afumishuhu ninyikwenzi yetu adi munyiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Hoshaŋa neyi, Yibimbi yawantu akadimbuka kala neyi wushi wamumaha, neyi mbutu jakukamatila muchikasa ila antu aaŋula dehi, kwosi niwakayikuŋulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Mukwamaana bayi adisamba namaana induku, mukwa bayi adisamba naŋovu jinduku, mukwakuheta bayi adisamba namahetidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwakudisamba adisambi nanochu chashinshikayi, nichaŋilu nindi yami Yehova nelaŋa mwaluwi, mwawuŋaji, nimwaloŋa hamaseki; muloŋa natiyaloŋa kuwaha nayumiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, mafuku akenza inakababesha antu ejima alamiru dehi, iku saŋa aduwu nawudima wawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niaEjipitu, niaYuda, niani, nianyana kaAmoni, niaMowabi, niatewulaŋa nsuki jawu mumawomu mawombu, ashakama mwisaŋa. Muloŋa nyuza yejima hiya yidima, niakwamutaŋa waIsarela nawa hiyayidima munyichima yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
